{"kind":"nirai","text":"கரைந்","tr":"karain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"காக்கையது","tr":"kākkaiyatu","foot":"tēmāṅkaṉi","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"காக்","tr":"kāk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கை","tr":"kai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யது","tr":"yatu"}]},{"text":"பலியே","tr":"paliyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பலி","tr":"pali"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"திண்டேர்","parts":[{"text":"திண்","lemma":"திண்","gloss":"strong"},{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"strong chariot"},{"surface":"நள்ளி","parts":[{"text":"நள்ளி","lemma":"நள்ளி","gloss":"Nalli (a chieftain)"}],"gloss":"Nalli"},{"surface":"கானத்து","parts":[{"text":"கானத்து","lemma":"கானத்து","gloss":"of the forest"}],"gloss":"of the forest","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அண்டர்","parts":[{"text":"அண்டர்","lemma":"அண்டர்","gloss":"cowherds"}],"gloss":"cowherds"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பல்லா","parts":[{"text":"பல்","lemma":"பல்","gloss":"many"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"cow"}],"gloss":"many cows"},{"surface":"பயந்த","parts":[{"text":"பய","lemma":"பய","gloss":"yield"},{"text":"ந்","lemma":"ந்","gloss":"euphonic glide"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"that yielded"},{"surface":"நெய்யில்","parts":[{"text":"நெய்","lemma":"நெய்","gloss":"ghee"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"than"}],"gloss":"than the ghee"},{"surface":"தொண்டி","parts":[{"text":"தொண்டி","lemma":"தொண்டி","gloss":"Tondi (a city)"}],"gloss":"the city of Tondi"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முழுதுடன்","parts":[{"text":"முழுதுடன்","lemma":"முழுதுடன்","gloss":"completely"}],"gloss":"completely","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"விளைந்த","parts":[{"text":"விளை","lemma":"விளை","gloss":"ripen/grow"},{"text":"ந்த","lemma":"ந்த","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"ripened"},{"surface":"வெண்ணெல்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்ணெல்","lemma":"வெண்ணெல்","gloss":"white rice"}],"gloss":"white rice","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வெஞ்சோ","parts":[{"text":"வெஞ்சோ","lemma":"வெஞ்சோறு","gloss":"hot rice (part 1)"}],"gloss":"hot rice (part 1)"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"றெழுகலத்து","parts":[{"text":"றெழுகலத்து","lemma":"றெழுகலத்து","gloss":"hot rice (part 2) in seven vessels"}],"gloss":"hot rice (part 2) in seven vessels","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஏந்தினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஏந்து","lemma":"ஏந்து","gloss":"hold/offer"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"இனும்","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if offered"},{"surface":"சிறிது","parts":[{"text":"சிறிது","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"small/insufficient"}],"gloss":"is small"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"friend"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருந்தோ","parts":[{"text":"பெருந்தோ","lemma":"பெருந்தோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ணெகிழ்த்த","parts":[{"text":"ணெகிழ்த்த","lemma":"ணெகிழ்த்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"செல்லற்கு","parts":[{"text":"செல்லற்கு","lemma":"செல்லற்கு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"விருந்து","parts":[{"text":"விருந்து","lemma":"விருந்து","gloss":"guest"}],"gloss":"guest"},{"surface":"வர","parts":[{"text":"வர","lemma":"வர","gloss":"to come"}],"gloss":"to come","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கரைந்த","parts":[{"text":"கரை","lemma":"கரை","gloss":"caw/call"},{"text":"ந்த","lemma":"ந்த","gloss":"past relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"which cawed"},{"surface":"காக்கையது","parts":[{"text":"காக்கை","lemma":"காக்கை","gloss":"crow"},{"text":"அது","lemma":"அது","gloss":"genitive suffix"}],"gloss":"of the crow"},{"surface":"பலியே","parts":[{"text":"பலி","lemma":"பலி","gloss":"offering"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic particle"}],"gloss":"the offering indeed"}]}],"literal":"Strong-charioted Nalli's forest cowherds' / many cows yielded ghee-with Tondi's / completely grown white rice hot rice / in seven vessels even if offered, is small, my friend, / large shoulders made-thin distress-for / guest to come cawed crow's offering indeed.","translation":"Even if we offer hot white rice, grown completely in the fields of Tondi and rich with the ghee yielded by the many cows of the forest-dwelling cowherds of the strong-charioted chieftain Nalli, served in seven large vessels, it would still be too small an offering for the crow that cawed to announce the arrival of our guest, curing the distress that made your large shoulders grow thin.","modern":"வலிமையான தேரை உடைய நள்ளியின் காட்டில் வாழும் இடையர்களின் பல பசுக்கள் தந்த நெய்யினைக் கொண்ட தொண்டித் துறையின் முழுமையாக விளைந்த வெண்ணெல்லின் சூடான சோற்றை, ஏழு கலங்களில் ஏந்திப் படைத்தாலும், என் தோழியே! உன்னுடைய பெரிய தோள்களை மெலியச் செய்த துன்பம் நீங்குமாறு, விருந்தினர் வருவதை அறிவித்துக் கரைந்த காக்கைக்கு நாம் அளிக்கும் பலி மிகச் சிறியதே ஆகும்.","explanation":"In this Mullai poem, the confidante speaks to the heroine upon the hero's return from his journey. She expresses her immense gratitude to the crow whose cawing heralded the arrival of the hero, thereby curing the heroine's deep distress that had caused her shoulders to waste away. The confidante declares that even an offering of seven large vessels filled with the finest hot white rice from the fertile region of Tondi, drenched in rich ghee from the forest herds of chieftain Nalli, would be too small a reward for this auspicious bird. This poem beautifully reflects the Mullai landscape's theme of patient waiting and the joyful relief of reunion. The poet Nacceḷḷaiyār famously earned the name 'Kākkai Pāṭiṉiyār' (the crow-singer) due to this vivid and celebrated portrayal of the crow as a messenger of hope.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.6],[0.6,1.3],[1.3,1.4],[1.4,1.6],[1.6,2.4],[2.4,2.8],[2.8,2.8],[2.8,4.1],[4.1,4.2],[4.2,4.7],[4.7,5.0],[5.0,5.1],[5.1,5.1],[5.1,7.4],[7.4,7.5],[7.5,8.22],[8.43,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,10.12],[10.12,10.12],[10.12,11.0],[11.0,11.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.7],[1.7,1.9],[1.9,2.18],[2.18,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,3.7],[3.7,5.1],[5.1,5.3],[5.3,5.8],[5.8,6.17],[6.17,6.9],[6.9,7.8],[7.8,8.6],[8.6,8.7],[8.7,9.58],[9.84,10.2],[10.2,10.8],[10.8,12.3],[12.3,12.3],[12.3,12.5],[12.86,13.4]]},"sync":[[["திண்டேர்","strong chariot"]],[["நள்ளி","Nalli"]],[["கானத்து","of the forest"]],[["கானத்து","of the forest"],["அண்டர்","cowherds"]],[["பல்லா","many cows"]],[["பயந்த","that yielded"]],[["நெய்யில்","than the ghee"]],[["தொண்டி","the city of Tondi"]],[["முழுதுடன்","completely"]],[["விளைந்த","ripened"]],[["வெண்ணெல்","white rice"]],[["வெஞ்சோ","hot rice (part 1)"]],[["றெழுகலத்து","hot rice (part 2) in seven vessels"]],[["றெழுகலத்து","hot rice (part 2) in seven vessels"],["ஏந்தினும்","even if offered"]],[["சிறிது","is small"],["என்","my"]],[["தோழி","friend"]],[["பெருந்தோ",""]],[["ணெகிழ்த்த",""]],[["செல்லற்கு",""]],[["விருந்து","guest"],["வர","to come"]],[["கரைந்த","which cawed"]],[["காக்கையது","of the crow"]],[["பலியே","the offering indeed"]]]}